{"_meta":{"source":"Yahoo Finance via yfinance (profile, statements, analyst estimates)","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T16:53:48+00:00","status":"ok","error":null,"last_success":"2026-10-30T16:53:48+00:00"},"data":{"profile":{"name":"Holmen AB (publ)","sector":"Basic Materials","industry":"Paper & Paper Products","country":"Sweden","city":"Stockholm","website":"https://www.holmen.com","employees":3500,"summary":"Holmen AB (publ) engages in the forest, paperboard, paper, wood products, and renewable energy businesses in Sweden and internationally. The company operates through Forest, Renewable Energy, Wood Products, and Board and Paper segments. Its Forest segment offers logs, pulpwood, and biofuel to sawmills, pulp mills, and board and paper mills. The Renewable energy segment provides renewable energy from hydro and wind power to the Nordic electricity market. Its Wood Products segment provides construction and joinery timber; CLT and glulam; and plus wood for pallets and packaging to construction, joinery, and packaging industries, as well as builders' merchants. The Board and Paper segment offers paperboards for consumer packaging and paper products for books, magazines, advertising, and transport packaging to brand owners, converters, wholesalers, publishers, printers, and retailers. The company was founded in 1609 and is headquartered in Stockholm, Sweden.","exchange":"Stockholm","currency":"SEK","financial_currency":"SEK","summary_fr":"Holmen AB (publ) s’engage dans les secteurs de la forêt, du carton, du papier, des produits du bois et des énergies renouvelables en Suède et à l’international. La société opère à travers les secteurs de la forêt, des énergies renouvelables, des produits du bois, du conseil et du papier. Son secteur Forêts offre des grumes, du bois à pâte et du biocarburant aux scieries, aux usines de pâte et aux usines de carton et de papier."},"valuation":{"market_cap_yahoo":45070184448,"shares_outstanding":105188066,"trailing_pe":21.710146,"forward